 **optimizations** (`-O3`-level) and no debug symbols. |\n| `-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr` | Where `make install` will place files (standard system location). |\n| `-DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=lib` | Put libraries in `/usr/lib` (not `/usr/lib64`). |\n| `-DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=icx` | Use Intel's **C compiler** (oneAPI \"icx\")."}